# Byte-exactness guard for the submission archive.
#
# The repo runs with core.autocrlf=true, which would rewrite these files to
# CRLF on checkout. Files here are archived verbatim and their SHA-256 is
# recorded in README.md, so any line-ending rewrite would silently invalidate
# the recorded hash. Pin them to LF on every platform.
* text eol=lf
